-- Purpose: Controls the UI, display, and client-side interactions for the Mythical Car Shop.
-- Runs on: Client
-- Location: StarterPlayerScripts.MythicalShopController
-- Dependencies: Players, ReplicatedStorage, SoundService, Lighting, TweenService, UserInputService
-- Public API: None
-- Networking: Invokes ShopRemotes.MythicalShop (Client -> Server)
-- Security: Purely visual client-side checks; server remains authoritative for all transactions.
-- Performance: Uses coroutines for typewriter effect; cancels stale jobs to prevent UI corruption.
-- Notes: Fixes the bug where missing cash inflates the "sacrifices left" dialogue.

-- FIXES (v2):
--   • ethourahSpeak now hides ALL shop frames (mainFrame + crafting) before showing the
--     NPC speech bubble — eliminates UI stacking/overlay.
--   • Added a job-ID generation counter so stale onDone callbacks from cancelled
--     typewriter jobs can never fire and corrupt UI state.
--   • getNpcUI / hideNpcUI helpers eliminate repeated FindFirstChild chains.
--   • cancelEthourahSpeak now correctly invalidates any in-flight job.
--   • Minor: cleaned up redundant pcall patterns and added inline comments.

